WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.650
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.580
Move out of the way, Zaizen.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.590
No matter the reason, I won't 
let others handle this.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:13.190
But if you insist on getting 
involved, you know how to stop me.

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:14.660
A duel?

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.980
That’s right.

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:19.230
If you win, I’ll accept your demands.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:20.940
Duel!

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.270
Hell's guard dog protects an angel…

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:29.150
Those monsters are like Akira and Aoi.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.280
The brother protects the sister.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.500
If the brother loses, the 
sister resurrects the brother.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.590
This is a tough combo.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:41.120
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:44.870
A Link 4 Cyberse has appeared!

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:52.540
It's Playmaker’s ace monster 
that defeated Revolver!

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:11.750
I run Across the universe

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:14.920
At the speed of light

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:16.790
Begin Loading

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:20.520
Open the door of dreams

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:24.090
VRAINS spreads

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:27.200
Believe in myself

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:30.730
VRAINS continues

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:36.040
The circuit draws the future

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:40.110
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:41.710
Access!

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:44.410
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:46.020
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.320
Link with my soul

00:01:48.430 --> 00:01:51.090
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:52.820
Now Win the Race

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.660
Connected world

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:59.160
No matter when

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:02.530
Nothing is impossible

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.670
Strive for hope

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:11.240
And ride the wind!

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:38.210
I’m counting on you, Yusaku.

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:40.380
I knew she'd come.

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:42.180
What will you do, Akira?

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:49.370
Firewall Dragon is Playmaker's 
strongest monster.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:53.200
But Tindangle Hound’s effect activates!

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:54.910
Hell Howling!

00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:05.640
Linked monsters on his field lose 
1000 ATK for every linked monster.

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:11.680
Oh my!  Firewall Dragon already lost ATK!

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:12.620
Here I go!

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:17.260
From my hand, I activate the 
spell card, Linkage Hole!

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:20.770
When I have a Link 4 or higher monster...

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:26.730
...it destroys a monster on your field for 
every Link 3 or higher monster on my field!

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:32.880
I have Link 3 Decode Talker 
and Link 4 Firewall Dragon!

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.720
Therefore, it destroys two monsters!

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.800
He destroyed two at once!

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:45.040
Destroying one at a time will 
activate your annoying effects.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:49.040
Now you can’t activate either effect!

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:57.190
Tindangle Hound’s effect ends, so 
my Link Monsters’ ATK are restored!

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:06.710
And since you have no monsters, 
Lemoine Point is also destroyed!

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.230
Battle!

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:12.300
Decode Talker attacks you directly!

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:15.110
Decode End!

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:22.840
Brother!

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:26.000
Your LP is in dangerous territory.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.040
I know!

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:30.520
Playmaker’s next attack will end you!

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.920
That won’t happen.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:37.340
I activate the trap card, Tindangle Delaunay!

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:42.110
When there are three Tindangles 
in the graveyard...

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:46.000
...you can activate it when 
he deals you battle damage.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:49.540
Your monster that dealt damage is destroyed.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:54.240
And I can Special Summon Tindangle 
Acute Cerberus from my Extra Deck!

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:55.080
What?

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:00.940
Decode Talker!

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:04.380
Appear, Tindangle Acute Cerberus!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:19.370
This pooch is scarier than the other one!

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:21.150
0 ATK.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:23.140
Then it must have an effect!

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:25.530
Acute Cerberus’s effect!

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:30.050
When Tindangle Hound or Tindangle 
Angel is in the graveyard...

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:34.050
...this card gains 1500 ATK for each one.

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.980
3000 ATK!

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:42.960
The duel so far was a setup.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.530
So this is his ace.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:48.930
I feel it's going to get bad.

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:51.920
I set one card and end my turn!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.430
Impressive, Akira.

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:59.640
You summoned your ace monster 
during your opponent’s turn.

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:02.240
My turn.  I draw!

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:04.240
Here I go, Playmaker!

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:05.200
Battle!

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:10.290
Acute Cerberus attacks Firewall Dragon!

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:12.680
Acute Math Blaze!

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:18.990
If Firewall is destroyed, we’ll lose!

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:20.130
I know!

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:23.860
I activate the trap, Doppler Phase Coating!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:27.560
I equip this card on Firewall Dragon!

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.140
Doppler Phase Coating’s effect!

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:35.870
Once per turn, the equipped monster 
isn't destroyed in battle!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.310
But you still take damage.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:43.780
Acute Cerberus’s effect!

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:50.520
After this monster attacks, you can 
Special Summon one Tindangle Token.

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:57.760
And Acute Cerberus gains 500 ATK for every 
Tindangle monster that it’s linked to.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.740
3500 ATK!

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:04.700
I can deal with that.

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:07.170
I set two cards.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:09.650
I end my turn.

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:10.840
Here I go!

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:12.680
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:17.720
I now activate the trap card, Gergonne's End!

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:21.770
This card equips on a Tindangle monster.

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:27.060
Battle nor effects can destroy the monster, 
and your opponent's effects can’t target it.

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:32.330
I equip this card on 
Tindangle Acute Cerberus!

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:36.710
When there are monsters 
next to all its links...

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:39.800
...you can send this card and the 
linked monsters to the graveyard...

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:43.810
... to deal damage equal to 
the equipped monster’s ATK.

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:46.080
That's not fair!

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:49.820
If effects nor battle can 
destroy it, it’s invincible!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.200
It’s a unique type of deck.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:55.820
It's hard to figure out, 
so it's hard to deal with.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:58.170
This is no time for commentary!

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:02.090
One of Acute Cerberus’s Link 
Markers points at my field.

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:05.500
So Gergonne's End won’t activate.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:08.970
But you only have 1500 LP left.

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:14.650
The ATK difference between his scary 
pooch and Firewall Dragon is 1000.

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:18.960
But if he summons a monster next 
to its link, it'll be 1500.

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:21.760
I activate a spell from my hand!

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:23.580
Alert Lancer!

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:29.420
When a Cyberse attacks a monster in defense 
position this turn, it deals piercing damage!

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:32.420
Wow!  I didn't think of that!

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:34.850
His Token has 0 DEF!

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:37.400
If you attack it, we win!

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:39.640
Go, Playmaker!

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:43.640
Firewall Dragon attacks Tindangle Token!

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.250
Tempest Attack!

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:51.710
Finish him!

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:55.420
I activate a Continuous Trap!

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:57.330
Morley's Shield!

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:05.170
Once per turn, battle damage with a 
Tindangle monster in the Main Monster Zone becomes 0.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:10.130
The monster is destroyed, 
but I take 0 damage!

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:12.880
He dodged it!

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:18.840
But the pooch is no longer linked 
to that monster, so it loses ATK!

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:21.850
I end my turn.

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:25.240
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:33.500
This card will stop another 
one of your strategies.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:37.850
I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Nagel's Protection!

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:40.860
When this card is on the field...

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.640
...Tindangle monsters in 
your Main Monster Zone

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:47.830
can’t be destroyed in battle or 
by your opponent’s card effects.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:52.640
That means we can't destroy 
your Token anymore?

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:53.810
Battle!

00:09:54.310 --> 00:09:58.240
Tindangle Acute Cerberus, 
attack Firewall Dragon!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.550
Acute Math Blaze!

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:09.760
Since we activated Doppler Phase Coating, 
Firewall Dragon can’t be destroyed!

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:11.860
I know that!

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:14.030
Nagel's Protection’s effect!

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:19.440
Once per turn, your Tindangle 
monster’s battle damage is doubled.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:27.170
The battle is over, so here's 
Acute Cerberus’s effect!

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:30.930
You can Special Summon a Tindangle Token.

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:36.850
Since Acute Cerberus is linked to 
another monster, it gains 500 ATK!

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:39.810
I end my turn.

00:10:39.810 --> 00:10:41.790
Oh no!

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:46.260
This is really bad, Playmaker!

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:52.270
Morley's Shield blocks damage, and Nagel's 
Protection saves his monsters from destruction.

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:58.270
I can't stop him from getting a Tindangle 
Token during each of his turns.

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:03.740
And if he meets Gergonne's End's 
requirements, my LP will drop to 0.

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:10.220
Even if he doesn’t, as long as Acute 
Cerberus has higher ATK, damage will be doubled.

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:14.720
Since I only have 500 LP, the 
next attack will drop me to 0.

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:17.730
Then do something about it!

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:20.700
But can anything be done?

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.360
Stop panicking.

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:24.720
Are you really an AI?

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:26.980
Why are you so calm!

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:30.640
I’m panicking because I 
know the odds of defeat!

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:33.700
Can you turn this around?

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:38.450
If you’re that worried, then 
think about your new home.

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:46.240
You’re fine if he breaks apart 
our passionate friendship?

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:48.480
There's no friendship between us.

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:53.930
You’re colder than an AI.

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:56.930
I don’t need warmth from people.

00:11:56.930 --> 00:12:01.280
Why don’t you act like an 
AI and explain the cards.

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:04.660
Fine!  I’ll talk like an AI!

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:06.650
"Stupid” is a forbidden word.

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:10.470
And our odds of winning are less than 5%.

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:13.500
No, our odds are much lower.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:17.380
But I'll say one thing.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:20.650
If you’re worried that I'll 
lose, you don't need to.

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:24.130
Because I definitely won’t lose.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:28.000
Not until I uncover the 
truth with my own hands.

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:32.680
This deck contains my feelings 
of the past ten years.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:35.370
I will find the truth!

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:37.170
I draw!

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:39.940
That card will determine your destiny!

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:44.520
Well, Playmaker?

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:46.420
I set a card.

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:48.880
I end my turn.

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:51.890
Looks like you can’t do anything.

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:54.860
But that is your destiny.

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:57.280
Stop your revenge.

00:12:57.280 --> 00:13:01.530
Let me handle this, and 
return to your normal life.

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:03.800
That's what’s best for you.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:07.340
Go to school.  Talk about the 
future with your friends.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:12.120
The days of youth are irreplaceable.  
Spend it with your friends.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:15.780
You'll cherish these memories in the future.

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:19.920
By being obsessed with the 
past, time is passing you by.

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:24.800
Don't let happiness slip away 
right in front of your eyes.

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:27.020
Just like I did…

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:30.020
He says there’s something 
in front of your eyes!

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:31.360
Where?

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:32.410
Brother!

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:38.130
Aoi?

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:43.760
Blue Angel…

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:49.820
Before this duel ends, I 
want to hear the true story.

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:52.450
What happened ten years ago?

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:54.640
She came out of hiding.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:59.820
Playmaker, LINK VRAINS has changed 
dramatically since you showed up.

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:04.490
I don’t know what I duel for anymore.

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:10.000
But if I learn what’s going on, if 
I know what you’re fighting for...

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:13.510
...I feel like I can move forward.

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:15.970
Tell me, Playmaker.

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:17.940
Brother!

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:19.910
Aoi…

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:22.870
I want to know too, Playmaker.

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.340
Because he knows, right?

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.850
Your secret will be revealed eventually.

00:14:28.770 --> 00:14:32.310
I’ll tell you what happened.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:37.770
An incident occurred ten years ago.

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:41.940
It’s called the "Lost Incident."

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:46.400
Six children went missing one-by-one.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:49.370
A certain organization kidnapped them.

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:50.570
Kidnapped?

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:54.680
Kidnapping?  What’s he talking about?

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:58.650
Yes.  And one of the six children is…

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:02.350
No way!  Was it you, Playmaker?

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:05.320
Playmaker was one of the victims?

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:07.300
Yusaku…

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:09.290
Stop, Zaizen.

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:12.750
I don’t want others to tell my past.

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:15.960
Playmaker…

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:21.850
After we were kidnapped, we 
were imprisoned separately.

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:37.180
The room contained nothing.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:41.330
Except for VR equipment.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:46.210
The VR showed a duel arena.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:50.060
We were forced to duel there.

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:52.100
You lose!

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:23.010
We could only eat, sleep and duel.

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:25.230
This repeated everyday.

00:16:25.230 --> 00:16:26.700
You lose!

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:36.390
Everything was based on dueling.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:40.180
If we don’t win a duel, 
we don’t get to eat.

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:47.490
When could we leave?  How long could we live?

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:52.460
We just kept dueling, worried 
because we knew nothing.

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:56.430
How horrible…  Who would 
do this to children?

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:07.900
No one told us where we were or how 
long we’ve been held captive.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:12.860
But half a year later, the 
incident suddenly ended.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:30.400
You can go home.

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:33.680
You gave it your all.

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:51.740
You were rescued.

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:54.780
But no one knows the culprit.

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:59.680
The incident was covered up, so 
the media didn’t raise a fuss.

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:03.150
Brother, do you know Playmaker’s identity-

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:04.030
Hold up!

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:06.990
Unfortunately, no.

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:13.310
Because the country's S Rank protection 
program protects the victims' information.

00:18:13.310 --> 00:18:17.210
Playmaker’s identity isn't stored here.

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:19.680
Phew.  That was close.

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:24.400
Zaizen, do you really think we were saved?

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:28.460
We weren’t saved!

00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:35.310
I have the right to know what 
the incident's mission was.

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:39.480
#1: That incident tore apart my life.

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:43.770
I'll learn the truth and reconnect 
my life that was torn apart!

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:49.500
#2: That incident deeply 
hurt us and our families.

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:53.240
Some still haven’t 
recovered from the shock.

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:58.720
I'll learn the truth for 
them and their families!

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.170
#3!

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:05.720
During those hellish days, when 
my heart was about to break…

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:08.000
You…  Hey, you.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:09.510
Be strong.

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.190
That voice again…

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.680
Three.

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:16.890
Don't forget to think of three things.

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:19.620
Three things to live.

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:22.080
Three things to go home.

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.800
Three things to defeat the enemy.

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:27.900
By thinking, you can still live.

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:31.480
Who are you?  Where are you?

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:33.850
I’m beside you.

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:36.860
You’re locked away too?

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:39.200
You can go home.

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:41.830
You can go home soon.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.800
I can leave?

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:46.800
So don’t lose hope.

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:48.780
Think of three things.

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:56.130
Whoever kept encouraging me 
wasn’t among the rescuees.

00:19:56.930 --> 00:20:02.250
If he's still captured, I have to rescue him!

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:08.500
The incident ten years ago 
hasn’t ended for me!

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:14.060
Zaizen, I don’t have what you talked about.

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:16.620
Since my life was cut short,

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:21.520
I have no future to talk about with 
my friends or irreplaceable moments.

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:25.250
So I guess I’m not your friend.

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:27.680
After the incident…

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:33.390
To heal the wounds in my heart, 
I received treatment for years.

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:40.840
I also tried hard to forget that incident.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:46.220
But no matter how much time passed…

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:49.580
You lose!

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:54.860
I couldn't forget.

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:59.850
Those horrible memories were burned 
into my eyes, feasting on my heart.

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:02.840
It became my flesh and blood 
that I couldn’t dig out.

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:08.760
When I realized that, I decided 
to face my own destiny.

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:13.720
If you think revenge is 
worthless, that’s fine.

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:19.060
But there are things I am 
destined to do to move forward.

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:23.300
I investigated the incident 
and found something.

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:27.170
The Lost Incident had another 
name: Hanoi Project!

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:29.250
Hanoi Project?

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:33.410
The Knights of Hanoi have something 
to do with the Lost Incident?

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:36.380
That’s why I’m after the Hanoi.

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:38.820
Hanoi Project…

00:21:38.820 --> 00:21:44.210
I see.  But it seems that’s 
the extent of your knowledge.

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:45.830
What do you mean?

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:51.300
The name of Hanoi Project’s 
mastermind is in this data.

00:21:51.300 --> 00:21:52.720
What?

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:54.730
Mastermind?

00:21:56.450 --> 00:21:59.700
Who is it?

00:22:24.340 --> 00:22:27.380
Dance!  Strike with your heels

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:30.890
Scream!  You Gotta Go  Raise your voice

00:22:31.310 --> 00:22:34.520
Sing!  Unleash your existence

00:22:34.810 --> 00:22:38.560
Get Away!  Until you surpass your limits

00:22:40.450 --> 00:22:42.450
Try It over and over

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:50.610
In this world that spreads forever

00:22:50.960 --> 00:22:57.550
The timeline flows forever

00:22:57.840 --> 00:23:00.110
Nothing is certain

00:23:00.240 --> 00:23:01.790
In these isolated times

00:23:02.070 --> 00:23:03.550
Set Yourself Free without hesitation

00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:05.320
Cuz We Still Believin' Magic

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:08.710
The traces we leave behind

00:23:08.850 --> 00:23:12.280
The traces we leave behind

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:16.250
The miracles we create

00:23:16.510 --> 00:23:18.490
Never Give Up Never!

00:23:18.490 --> 00:23:22.340
I won't give up  Never Give Up Never!

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:40.830
One follows his conscience, 
one is consumed by revenge.

00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:45.980
Their goals are the same, 
but their beliefs are not.

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:49.770
They knew from the start that 
they'd oppose each other.

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:55.340
This duel is for justice 
and cannot be avoided.

00:23:55.340 --> 00:23:59.580
I only believe in my justice!

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:03.080
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Unyielding Justice

00:24:03.080 --> 00:24:05.090
Into the VRAINS!
